[18.234093, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[18.234119, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> **Output Data Schema**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[18.234145, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[18.234213, "o", "The output JSON file '\"'\"'/app/active_users_report.json'\"'\"' must be an array of objects with the following structure:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
